guide polestar-experimental/riverglades-alliance-4
title Riverglades 4: Turner's Logging Camp, the Cinderscale hollow and the Western Front (experimental)
faction Alliance
levels 41-43
zone Riverglades
coords live
folder Riverglades · Experimental
why Forever's new zone, an alpha route written from players' recordings.
keywords riverglades, western front, sergeant riftan, marshal ryan, gelinda, cinderscale, farholde, experimental, alpha
next forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas when level>=43
next forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale when level<43

# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Alliance, part 4 of 4 (2026-11-12). Hand-written from players'
# recordings of the zone and Forever's quest data for titles, levels, objectives and places.
# Order: Farholde Keep's errands for the west; Terral's Watch (with Sister Rowland's phial on the way for players who
# took Brother Lowley's jobs); Turner's Logging Camp; Gelinda Coppergleam's Cinderscale hollow south-west of Southern
# Watch (levels 39-42); Sergeant Riftan's camp below Twilight's Shroud and the Twilight cult's camps and ogre mine
# (levels 41-44); the hearth to Farholde Keep; Stormwind for Marshal Ryan's crest; Menethil Harbor and the boat to
# Theramore, where the Feralas guide (43-45) starts; below level 43, the Stranglethorn Vale guide (40-43) from
# Theramore instead.
# Class trainers: none in the Riverglades. Whoever passes through Stormwind trains there; a player going on to
# Feralas (level 43 or more) flies there to train in any case, as the Feralas guide passes no trainer (shamans train
# in Ironforge); the Stranglethorn Vale guide has its own Stormwind and Ironforge stops.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings): High Stakes after Foreman's Plight;
# Bring Me His Head after Sergeant Riftan's first three; News to Farholde after Bring Me His Head; Dying Wish after
# Saving Marshal Ryan; Delivering Closure after Dying Wish; The Twilight Threat after News to Farholde.
# Elites, each behind a group choice: Overlord Kilgar (46).
# The Twilight camps hold elites the route never asks for: Twilight Enforcers (45) on patrol, Executioner Morg and
# Overlord Kilgar (46) in the fortress, the Twilight Forgemaster (46, rare).
# Left out on purpose:
# - Upstream Contamination (96085): Krek the Noxious is an elite (42) far north, by the training grounds.
# - Hail the Dragonslayer (95935): it starts from the head of Scaldaron, a rare elite drake in the Cinderscale
#   hollow.
# - Key Ingredients (94981): Alphonse Dumas wants crafted materials.
# Krol'dok Stronghold (`when dungeon "Krol'dok Stronghold"`, dungeons in the route), for a group of five: a character
# who runs it takes Ashe Amberhall's Tome of Twilight (94984) and Demar Brant's Eye of Mugg (94982) at the end of
# part 3 and Sergeant Riftan's Twilight Mementos (94983) at his camp; the run comes after Bring Me His Head, at 43 (the
# dungeon's floor), from the door north of Sunnyglade, about 362 yd from Riftan's camp, where 16 people went in.
# Riftan takes the bangle and gives Lingering Essence (94997) for Ashe; the hearth to Farholde Keep brings the other
# hand-ins: Ashe's two (then her Curios of Curiosity, 94998, for Melanie Sable), Demar Brant's, and Tunk the
# blacksmith's Krol'dok Moulding (94980) for Alphonse Dumas.

step Farholde Keep
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Before you head west: Bertrand Ironbrow and Cassandra Wheeler, by the inn, both have work at Turner's Logging Camp.
  accept 96009                          -- Bertrand Ironbrow: High Stakes
  accept 95330                          -- Cassandra Wheeler: Love Thy Neighbor

step Something's in the Water
  when onquest 96084
  tip North past Terral's Watch: fill Sister Rowland's phial in the marsh water north-east of the tower.
  use 281229 quest 96084.1 @62.0,56.2   -- Empty Phial

step Terral's Watch
  tip Watcher Cornelius's tower.
  turnin 94927                          -- Watcher Cornelius: Dunston Checks Out
  turnin 95329                          -- Out in the Field

step Turner's Logging Camp
  tip West across the river to Turner's Logging Camp: the Peasant Woodpiles around the camp give the wood bundles.
  turnin 95330                          -- Halligan Turner
  collect 271877 x10 quest 96009.1      -- Wood Bundle

step Gelinda Coppergleam
  tip South-west past Southern Watch: Gelinda Coppergleam, a prospector, has camped by the Cinderscale dragonkin's hollow.
  accept 95792                          -- Clear 'em Out
  accept 95934                          -- Proof of Profit

step The Cinderscale hollow
  tip The whelps nest all over the hollow; the warriors (level 41-42) guard its back, by the Cubic Draconia. Scaldaron, a rare elite drake, can be up here too: leave him be unless you have a group.
  kill 262473 x8 quest 95792.1 @30.0,72.2  -- Cinderscale Whelp
  kill 262477 x4 quest 95792.2 @29.6,73.1  -- Cinderscale Warrior
  collect 271611 quest 95934.1          -- Cubic Draconia

step Gelinda Coppergleam
  turnin 95792
  turnin 95934


step Sergeant Riftan
  tip North up the long valley towards Twilight's Shroud: Sergeant Riftan holds a small camp below the Twilight cult's fortress.
  turnin 94886                          -- Sergeant Riftan
  accept 94888                          -- No Soldier Left Behind
  accept 94889                          -- Carving a Path
  accept 96015                          -- A Miner Problem

step Sergeant Riftan
  when dungeon "Krol'dok Stronghold"
  when level>=41.9
  accept 94983                          -- Sergeant Riftan: Twilight Mementos, a Twilight Bangle from the cult inside the stronghold

step The Twilight camps
  tip The cult's camps fill the valley north and west of Riftan. Free the captive Farholde Scouts as you find them, and kill a Twilight Thrall for Ashe: her soulstone takes it. Twilight Enforcers (elites, level 45) patrol through the camps: watch where they walk before each pull. Overlord Kilgar and Executioner Morg (elites, 46) hold the fortress at the valley's head: pull the cultists away from them.
  kill 256795 x8 quest 94889.1          -- Twilight Fanatic
  kill 256797 x8 quest 94889.2          -- Twilight Corrupter
  kill 256799 x8 quest 94889.3          -- Twilight Champion
  complete 94888 @27.7,41.5             -- free five captive Farholde Scouts
  complete 94907 @26.6,47.8             -- kill a Twilight Thrall

step Marshal Ryan
  when onquest 94887
  tip Marshal Ryan lies wounded among the camps at the valley's western edge.
  complete 94887 @26.2,40.8             -- find Marshal Ryan and talk to him
  turnin 94887
  accept 94892                          -- Dying Wish: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep

step The ogre mine
  tip North of the camps the cult works ogre miners in a mine, driven by the Twilight Subjugators.
  kill 260995 x5 quest 96015.1          -- Ogre Miner
  kill 260996 x5 quest 96015.2          -- Twilight Subjugator

step Sergeant Riftan
  turnin 94888
  turnin 94889
  turnin 96015

step Bring Me His Head
  when group 94890
  tip Overlord Kilgar is an elite (level 46) in the fortress at the head of the valley, with the Enforcers around him: grouping up is advised.
  accept 94890                          -- Sergeant Riftan
  collect 265837 quest 94890.1 @26.7,44.9  -- Kilgar's Head
  turnin 94890
  accept 94891                          -- News to Farholde: for Ashe Amberhall

step Krol'dok Stronghold
  when dungeon "Krol'dok Stronghold"
  when onquest 94983,94984,94982
  when level>=43
  tip Krol'dok Stronghold is a dungeon for a group of five, levels 40 to 47. Its door is north of Sunnyglade at the foot of the Twilight valley, a short walk from Sergeant Riftan's camp.
  tip Inside: a Twilight Bangle from the cult for Riftan, the Tome of Twilight from Nar'gurk for Ashe Amberhall and the Eye of Mugg from Overlord Mugg for Demar Brant. Tunk the blacksmith drops the Krol'dok Moulding, which starts a quest for Alphonse Dumas in Farholde Keep.
  enter "Krol'dok Stronghold" @37.2,43.9
  complete 94983 @37.2,43.9             -- Twilight Mementos: a Twilight Bangle, inside
  complete 94984 @37.2,43.9             -- Tome of Twilight: Nar'gurk, inside
  complete 94982 @37.2,43.9             -- Eye of Mugg: Overlord Mugg, inside

step Sergeant Riftan
  when dungeon "Krol'dok Stronghold"
  when complete 94983
  tip Back to Sergeant Riftan's camp, a short walk from the door.
  turnin 94983                          -- Sergeant Riftan
  accept 94997                          -- Sergeant Riftan: Lingering Essence, for Ashe Amberhall in Farholde Keep

step Hearth to Farholde Keep
  hearth "Farholde Keep"

step Farholde Keep
  tip From the inn: Bertrand Ironbrow on the way in, then Demar Brant and Ashe Amberhall in the keep.
  turnin 96009                          -- Bertrand Ironbrow
  turnin 94907                          -- Ashe Amberhall

