  when turnedin 94891
  accept 94894                          -- Demar Brant: Kilgar's head for Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep

step Sister Rowland
  when onquest 96084
  tip Sister Rowland, in the cathedral at the keep's south-west corner.
