step Stormwind
  when onquest 94893
  tip Gretchen Mayberry flies to Stormwind. Abigail Lawson waits in the Cathedral Square.
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 94893                          -- Abigail Lawson

step Stormwind Keep
  when onquest 94894
  zone Stormwind City
