step Train before Feralas
  only !Shaman
  when level>=43
  when !zone "Stormwind City"
  tip No class trainer stands in the Riverglades, and the Feralas guide passes none: Gretchen Mayberry flies to Stormwind, where you train before you go on.
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

step Your class trainer
  only !Shaman
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  tip No class trainer stands in the Riverglades: train here in Stormwind before you fly on.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid
  note Level 40 with 100 gold? Your race's riding trainer teaches riding: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each race's mounts.

step Shaman trainer
  only Shaman
  when level>=43
  tip No shaman trainer stands in the Riverglades or in Stormwind, and the Feralas guide passes none: fly to Ironforge and train there on your way to Menethil Harbor.
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge
  train class only Shaman
  note Level 40 with 100 gold? Your race's riding trainer teaches riding: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each race's mounts.

step Leave Stormwind
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The next guide starts in Theramore: fly to Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands and take the boat across from there. Stormwind's gryphon master stands in the Trade District.
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  when !zone "Wetlands"
  tip The next guide starts in Theramore: fly to Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands and take the boat across from there.
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"
